{
    "title": "Bored Button Offline Games",
    "description": "\ud83c\udfc6 Join the Elite: Bored Button, the Play Pass Sensation! \r\n\r\nBored Button Offline Games & No Wifi Games\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfa9 Become part of an exclusive gaming club by indulging in Bored Button! Bored Button is your answer to fighting boredom with 100+ games at your finger tips, no new downloads needed! Play your favorite games, set a new personal record and tap the red bored button whenever you're ready for a new challenge. \r\n\r\n\u25b6\ufe0f Google Play Pass subscribers, have an even better ad free experience: no ads, no interruptions, just pure, unadulterated fun.\r\n\r\n\u2b50 Ad-Free Bliss, Endless Joy: As a loyal Google Play Pass subscriber, unlock a seamless gaming experience with Bored Button. Say goodbye to pesky ads and hello to uninterrupted joy. Enjoy the full spectrum of games, challenges, and surprises without any distractions, allowing you to immerse yourself fully in the captivating world of Bored Button, all in a single download. Your Play Pass subscription just got a whole lot more exciting \u2013 download Bored Button now and elevate your gaming experience to new heights! :rocket::video_game: #PlayPass #BoredButton #AdFree\r\n\r\n\u25b6\ufe0f Downloaded by over 8 Million gamers and featured in 100 + countries\u2026\r\n\r\n**The Game Collection**\r\n\r\nThe game collection of Bored Button consists of more than 100 games from wide range of genres. From brain teasing puzzle games to featured new arcade games, from friv games to classic board games are in the same collection and they are ready for you to enjoy with just a tap.\r\n\r\nFirst you will be served a pack of new games in an order to analyze your game taste, then a new game which is calibrated to your personal taste will be presented to you.\r\n\r\nIf you like to play unique puzzle games like Ancient Blocks, then friv games will not be presented to you, games like Hexaginta will be prepared for you next. But if you like friv games like Sticky Goo then games like Babel will be ready for you to play with your next tap.   \r\n\r\nWe get that your game taste can change time to time, in that case the system will detect the change and adapt the following games on-the-go to find your next favorite game. \r\n\r\n**Create Your Own Games List and Play Offline**\r\n\r\nWhile surfing through games, you will of course love some of them more and want to be able play them whenever you want. So you can add the ones you loved to your favorites by just tapping the plus icon at the menu and save it to your personalized games list which will always be free and available for you to play. \r\n\r\nWhile you are saving the games and creating your own list, the system will analyze your most liked ones and save them for offline play so you can enjoy Bored Button even when you are in an airplane or a subway :) \r\n\r\n**No More Searching for New Games**\r\n\r\nJust give it a go and start playing now. You will be addicted to the smoothness and have fun with the flexibility of discovering a new game . There will be no need to search for a new game when you get bored of one. For your own convenience, we do that for you. It is now just a tap away to discover your next favorite game with Bored Button. \r\n\r\n**No Need to Update for New Games**\r\n\r\nWe are constantly adding new games to the database. Despite other gaming apps, you do not need to update the app every time you want to play a new game. \r\n\r\nYou can play the most popular new games in just seconds by just tapping the button again. \r\n\r\nDownload it now for free!!\r\n\r\nFor any inquiries please contact us through support@unite.io",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83c\udfc6 Join the Elite: Bored Button, the Play Pass Sensation! <br><br>Bored Button Offline Games &amp; No Wifi Games<br><br>\ud83c\udfa9 Become part of an exclusive gaming club by indulging in Bored Button! Bored Button is your answer to fighting boredom with 100+ games at your finger tips, no new downloads needed! Play your favorite games, set a new personal record and tap the red bored button whenever you&#39;re ready for a new challenge. <br><br>\u25b6\ufe0f Google Play Pass subscribers, have an even better ad free experience: no ads, no interruptions, just pure, unadulterated fun.<br><br>\u2b50 Ad-Free Bliss, Endless Joy: As a loyal Google Play Pass subscriber, unlock a seamless gaming experience with Bored Button. Say goodbye to pesky ads and hello to uninterrupted joy. Enjoy the full spectrum of games, challenges, and surprises without any distractions, allowing you to immerse yourself fully in the captivating world of Bored Button, all in a single download. Your Play Pass subscription just got a whole lot more exciting \u2013 download Bored Button now and elevate your gaming experience to new heights! :rocket::video_game: #PlayPass #BoredButton #AdFree<br><br>\u25b6\ufe0f Downloaded by over 8 Million gamers and featured in 100 + countries\u2026<br><br>**The Game Collection**<br><br>The game collection of Bored Button consists of more than 100 games from wide range of genres. From brain teasing puzzle games to featured new arcade games, from friv games to classic board games are in the same collection and they are ready for you to enjoy with just a tap.<br><br>First you will be served a pack of new games in an order to analyze your game taste, then a new game which is calibrated to your personal taste will be presented to you.<br><br>If you like to play unique puzzle games like Ancient Blocks, then friv games will not be presented to you, games like Hexaginta will be prepared for you next. But if you like friv games like Sticky Goo then games like Babel will be ready for you to play with your next tap.   <br><br>We get that your game taste can change time to time, in that case the system will detect the change and adapt the following games on-the-go to find your next favorite game. <br><br>**Create Your Own Games List and Play Offline**<br><br>While surfing through games, you will of course love some of them more and want to be able play them whenever you want. So you can add the ones you loved to your favorites by just tapping the plus icon at the menu and save it to your personalized games list which will always be free and available for you to play. <br><br>While you are saving the games and creating your own list, the system will analyze your most liked ones and save them for offline play so you can enjoy Bored Button even when you are in an airplane or a subway :) <br><br>**No More Searching for New Games**<br><br>Just give it a go and start playing now. You will be addicted to the smoothness and have fun with the flexibility of discovering a new game . There will be no need to search for a new game when you get bored of one. For your own convenience, we do that for you. It is now just a tap away to discover your next favorite game with Bored Button. <br><br>**No Need to Update for New Games**<br><br>We are constantly adding new games to the database. Despite other gaming apps, you do not need to update the app every time you want to play a new game. <br><br>You can play the most popular new games in just seconds by just tapping the button again. <br><br>Download it now for free!!<br><br>For any inquiries please contact us through support@unite.io",
